{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1391,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5a8cfe327883446d092a0d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "試行錯誤を重ね、美味しいチョコが\r\nできたと思うのですが…好みも\r\nありますし…お口に合うでしょうか",
      "source_fingerprint": "44bfc467e6aff0628805382fadee78dca1f61e5fc2659f0f0c1005b3c2e5628e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c73de6e07d458fd6b71e792",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "七夕…短冊に願いを記し成就を祈る\r\n言葉にすることで、自身の目標を\r\n再確認できるのはよいですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "07f3ae7497034d1972b8dbc0fe5a1142980b09080474f43765543b81127d00a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d3a808ea7102ef139314c87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トリックオアトリートと言いますが\r\n私はイタズラをしてみたいですね。\r\n握手をした手がとれる、など…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c571d706cbc1b1b9a29667d7515cf1e3bc41e40b1a41344ab18ef6ce2c9aead0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0855db32c29a8e0e7e737af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "1年で最も忙しい季節…だからこそ\r\n予定を組むのにも力が入ります。\r\n共によいクリスマスを迎えましょう",
      "source_fingerprint": "068566a503182520ba1026d44e5519201ddb436643aede866a48288e8dbd18f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fd64b9cb20999dd40ad1066",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "プレゼントは、お気に召していただ\r\nけるかと…友人たちに協力いただき\r\n最適な贈り物を導き出せましたので",
      "source_fingerprint": "83551ea48d2de37a2ad41c7f6921c614bc41c634d26b16db2cb24dd1e422d760",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c24e69a9e01c28dbf62a8e10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上々の結果です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2546f30de1a67103edd64d5722dd4588b92b89a93121c04b973ac34f63f68aa3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:716a9c7a3de53fd12154bb47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "年末の大掃除はトレーナー室から。\r\n卓上、窓、壁、床と高い場所より\r\n順に埃を落としていきましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a5989e2507420432dff068398ff2519b13b2a100f10716fa1425a5635e1a40c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:932f4152d886b5a32afc6433",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お誕生日のお祝いに、特製ケーキを\r\nご用意しました。生地に野菜を練り\r\n込んでおり栄養バランスは完璧です",
      "source_fingerprint": "959de19484d66614469031da75e78ead207bdee8a8595be9427d132aa763ca56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b664077a1b19271eb2504bda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "誕生日にサイクルボトルを贈ります\r\n遠出には水分補給が必要ですので。\r\n…その…次の休日のご予定は…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c34fe14ccf8e09b2724ab0f05b104343757a993697c7e184422fe3e849724b2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2362ce00f5cf571480cb61ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ネイチャさんの手料理、ターボさん\r\nのダンス、タンホイザさんの一発芸\r\n…ふふ、楽しい誕生日会でした。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ba23cb3ab465092c9a5b8dc49e76bed7f42acd528deac6f4e4486f3ab912959",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b3aa262d113e77430446fc7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "誕生日プレゼント…？…日々、共に\r\n歩んでくださる、それが何よりの\r\n贈り物です。どうか、これからも…",
      "source_fingerprint": "891db073191c0abfd07f590d474a6ee4e682290bb1418412e9a7c617ae4213e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98dec49088455a1d07334fc8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お知らせが届いているようです。\r\n重要な案件かもしれません。\r\n早急に確認すべきかと。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19e8d913ec4d5720980e1d56b5e469e8ab178a57a340c593f5d97d9982d08ed5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d33715a56c1f5c9bb47113cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "プレゼントが届いているようです。\r\nすぐ確認されるようでしたら、\r\nお持ちしますよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bac693ddbb090c8ef371fb5097f898e1699a64cf4cc2bde38b2bfe6f148a535",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67e82c91a416e56836ded29c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ミッション達成です。達成内容は\r\nこちらで記録しておきますので、\r\n報酬の受け取りをお願いできますか",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cef260257a73aa0b12e3edec44d6d0a102b1f6f6030b734fba355e3bbf0da18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4432bff93265813b2744c133",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベントが開催されるようですね。\r\nスケジュールは余裕をもって\r\n組んでおくことにしましょうか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "46bcec828693396ec11e3867be36d738bdcab39fcd649cbe598c0169a63d9a86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a9957d58e165325f370dfcb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベントが催されているようです。\r\nスケジュールに余裕はありますので\r\n是非、楽しまれてみては？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5132b2d8ac9e235dad1fa2e9c79094db1c7a77ff94765bbc51676fabb518c833",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ae6e5db3161eeeb6487fcb2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やりますね…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "744da42bbc01be20779d08218d572a4127b639b16274b57f3b81879bec673389",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9845eae4ca9b901114bcdfcc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ウマ娘名鑑のレベルが\r\n上がったようです。\r\n早速、ご確認を。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99a8b3136db88e00ec697b11b5a5aa3751d721a269a5345e84698b5c72bdf224",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd50141c333249b2963b8401",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "次に活かしましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3d9b2f15acac2d6ebc8306fcbe2917603c29461298b9688ae08c97210c0aee5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5039cffe726acee761b9ad3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これが結束の力です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa149d540e853230480419b728f204fa4fe15f0a0e085ae3c22abe7b91d1a95d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb1366023e16cb44748f2106",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やりますね…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "744da42bbc01be20779d08218d572a4127b639b16274b57f3b81879bec673389",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e217bd294e089dd4925909e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "次に活かしましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3d9b2f15acac2d6ebc8306fcbe2917603c29461298b9688ae08c97210c0aee5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2750489fd6943f8b9d45e0c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おお…スコア更新です！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff0b2417dceb0f7031c39ddbc72aae3294cf382a1d59e6f32fdadc1361bd3aba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7976ac1f1a6aed7cc037effc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各自、打ち合わせ通りに。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2367b7edfae471eaa9bbd3fe84dd82e102af9a9bbf9780d3f1fe7e583120f017",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8ae39285b7adef255d13c55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2f56a6df87fc3e8c3daa12e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーニングですね。\r\nすべて手筈は整っております。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebeb00c89b48dafe5a85b96706038822034b5cdaab91d6e2d18113cf92d7753f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b32c366f7af9e1c10d66e4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "温故知新、過去を知ることは\r\n大変有意義かと思います。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ba035772891778554e65ac60e4567f3de06cc720fc5fb0f210b4fa74ee01b8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20e81650e5178086b40c10ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "レースにエントリーを？\r\n出走計画に反映しておきます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba7c718b2e2dcd7a28ba0474b48df94c91d41d24bfb38a98615c6c70d3a41e09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83b19f3c5dcec36b918ed05b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "必ず。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a04cce7c1a8cd73007d2fd55999a750f8ed115b931b66ddec6fc88ff8a36373",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "1193"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10e2c75c45dec7372abc9fed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全力で。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b202728095c87fa9ec97b366968c3bee738cc377ab3fa01b771c580b8d1c1016",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "1194"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5a20a018cb770a4eca1b2d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ウマ娘、プリティーダービー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cfce02d59976c4a687f79d00d7894df0b5a6c879fbee1d653e3f267a88ff06d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1fe9ed63584c5b2396ce022",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この力は、想定外です…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e68a9312a22ad580377c6491109707867eb45e96b12f3ff9637cfc5236358e66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e565ee1973ca0c85188b7daa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本日分のログインボーナスです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0456da928551a7b666edd4d57003022fafa482851f5db144f50d9979da299133",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8801e3753491e73710247478",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ご健闘を…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30ae2d49334382fe76b92245f6e992133593babf19f7e23030d278c4d59b777d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43a9da2866020f0b2b220a3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おおっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2990e25c4ba4bddd68079b4013cbafef9f553616a3b12668e479777a8a0ca10e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab28361306fcdd15b7c20d8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ああ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d3e5f5f0582b2a21d0f86c22b551c167ae6e481619c57ccf6d904aba02eff30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e64e458321d44c24fdf15b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お見事です！",
      "source_fingerprint": "71fe93f577cde2476c1cc9ea4e671a3c94f880fd16ce1f766af5b1d01e477741",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8305cb1d20e725416114ce92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "こんな才能をお持ちとは…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "094d7a7e07ce8d9467e6fc2ae7177f85456a0606047cd8350f2f625d393953c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a66e9cf2c6edadb471021edc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "難度は高かったですから…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b40d7a824b6467c842ee16b916725ac1c7b67b630ed921c24f42f25765a8f78a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "140005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a59caf59d329194edf90573",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お見事です！",
      "source_fingerprint": "71fe93f577cde2476c1cc9ea4e671a3c94f880fd16ce1f766af5b1d01e477741",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "140006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:748ef727d3507b68d61e340b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "こんな才能をお持ちとは…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "094d7a7e07ce8d9467e6fc2ae7177f85456a0606047cd8350f2f625d393953c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "140007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfb3a58d6e61cee942484d04",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふふっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbc78ca5d65302a8b38bec657661270c58ae9fac943c1c718a7fa71c2d75ec30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "140008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ad2319f3c528daab6b9d249",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "んん…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "213a7633b40c57dd79bd554bd3e66aecd2890e1c312bdae01e72fb62f283bb7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "140009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:896ab5a90ac6df8425cfa321",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "む。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b98e289944aa43753187806cbd6977d5097f8b31fb305c58eb62572608825cd5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "140010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78018a2a1f79cc487d948208",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "チャンスです！慎重に…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62aaa9df32e8912431e4accec378c8ccec46cd519dcc0ad87ba8137a1969f7d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "140011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef67a57859fe27307febec6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なんという…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bab22c78ffa7632fce6c57000ec257c7e18ca793915a86a7a46eb2a02ed5ef4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f21f2fc52a2b221e9cf83333",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "素晴らしい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e934a62b37525801eb70bc01539679d41030aa44b40e88ec2cd7094d0750fe4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c6820bf086c743a6ce3a659",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "11c7fa2e8ca165bf7b84e9505989c5dd8d95e375903d51850708d69a745ba142",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6e07e1aedd182cba30f7150",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふむ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cc85de9baa6672c2c81baee59b07561bae8d6e1b887a3e92e1cd1b692282626",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59bcb18291e3c34233a65f20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあ、どうぞ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa34476a13ef58d62d559b43d08cf126611a3182754c76dd8c1641479df260cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:299b906ec650d4d924cf504d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なっ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6057e38bffc9b8b1ac2789a1b261be32229344ac84a55242c1d49aff2b2ec74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9c8b2d8ee1c71422d1b1355",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ままなりませんね…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5daba97326da9fe22599d043f9bd79b91c6727509c4cc30b587a19d702f963e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7189738788fc18d2791e92f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明日はこちらの予定です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "682cf9ddc5c926451a337996ee05f9ec5328863aeaf2282acc41dab938a5de9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4d9b4800b18a64b6bfbd724",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "っ…若干ですが疲労が蓄積している\r\nようです。今後のリスクを考え、\r\n休養も選択肢のひとつかと…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4da6420b1ef6a41828d5bceffd7ad47520079fb20fafed7ec43fe9c94b4c30d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0e9d38b205206213dc31a18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "現状のままですと…行動に支障を\r\nきたす可能性があります。その点は\r\nご認識おきいただけますと…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8453e5be5a9cbcb51afe54483568214a673a950c93acbdc2cb59ef1da34fd46c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bf53f8464168e0565a83a2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この軽やかさ…！グリスアップを\r\n施した翌日に匹敵しますよ！\r\nあ…つまりは絶好調という事です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03c6e6fd78ec4061ec836dcbc35eb6aa9a9475897fa1133e52aaa3722155e306",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b8193cfc429e2ebb8289446",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "膝が笑っているようです。いえ、\r\n疲労ではなく走ることへの期待…\r\nつまり“うずうず”しているのです",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f0d52ee9b7ec91ec239b2c719dcbaac49abd39f157c4f22ea4191d85a7c3d7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75a5fb9e3f5a28d6d2ae2385",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "コンディションは平均より良好。\r\n想定以上の成果を上げられるかと。\r\n負荷上限を見極めるよい機会です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc1d1a9a15e216a69aa74c438333743310e88ae3edf161464fa6235485f3ae54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d56b19d9b05b294c3e81bd1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心身共に好調です。伴いまして、\r\nモチベーションも高まっています。\r\n期待していただけますと。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b6ecd8669251bd4ebdc8597af7870420f89f771151635d8b86c1a72825eefca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e9c43e7711ac8812f3c834b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本日も平素と変わりありません。\r\n予定通りのトレーニングで\r\n問題ないかと思います。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37a36161a3a68fbfe610189de523184ee20e20def8140f69885a2e337a6d4284",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7d93648917cd5e11b2eb40b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "調子の如何にかかわらず、\r\nやるべきことをやりましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8537a660ba3ea925095c57347460563a8dd6bffb1720ac0f4a712ea8d0502b56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a107aa434ea7f712e42a7ef2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "む…例えるならば、変速が\r\nスムーズにいかない感覚です…。\r\n様子を見つついきましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43a2bb733430cfdedb6041c8e266cc1de1d42c3e753481f80ef32ea68b2dacfd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:696283d083068be206496714",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いつものように…というわけには\r\nいきそうもない調子です。\r\n…ケガには気をつけなければ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b560ec890b378e1e880c72eaea7574529e4b090332bbb3e34226f16aaaed4295",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea530730ca7e774ac6b404a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本日の予定は――\r\nえー…しばしお待ちください。\r\nすみません…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c269c4a729436f0c9151acb8692c2ac18546c3c168a7f347c4513caf0ac27ee3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad95a1c6bf9c40c39fa32da7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "くっ…不調であっても…。\r\n今日のデータをもとに、\r\n今後に役立てるまで…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e0edf498b29f82b4dffc00c5358c996b8da3df4376b2b94d7f11336ac6d3705",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7308e09a58fbc088d7fc7790",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "連続出走ですか…。どうしてもと\r\n仰るならば、意図に関しては\r\n明確なものをご提示くださいませ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1860537c74bb56fc1a425df9445e40ea4a8a0966b2482c4bc21630d116ea4991",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9b4e1cdc455679ff1945b41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更なる連戦ですか…承知しました。\r\n絶対の勝機を見出されたのでしたら\r\n…この身を削ってでもお応えします",
      "source_fingerprint": "611969c8d4816dfe6c90a0a41740dbdff2360b620d45b4934fb84d95bfbcfdca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:793efdef4e780fd443d44d70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "調整は万全。気力も充分…。\r\n万事順調に事が運びました。\r\nあとは、勝利を収めるのみです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83f2914e8c137856cbebadbc7a8defaffff798041ee6f8d5f4378c08261aa831",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22af299aa9cc5455ef709e94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ここまでの調整は想定通りです。\r\nレースに際しても、\r\nそれが覆ることはないでしょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b96f3c67c593290a8195ee13d718465c9a37746c34f612628f89b4be52fce7da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebdd302ef774d5f2c153346e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "万全を期して、ここに至りました。\r\nあとは実践に挑むのみです。さあ、\r\n私たちの成果を披露しましょう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a19c1c550ef820053ab2ad83c5f787fa1a853fa8fd3bcb6c41cba73ba4d1ee4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe07df7a81359145b8915197",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状況は、概ね想定した通りです。\r\nイレギュラーが生じなければ、\r\n勝利への道筋は明るいでしょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9015978e4e5402624ac6738afef30eab07c21870ddcdeefaabe2cdebbc28a02f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d35b44a79cbaa9c6a233acfe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私は勝つ…！そう思えるのです。\r\n精神的な強さは勝敗を左右します。\r\nであれば、明言するのが得策かと。",
      "source_fingerprint": "71dbcbf12723fa180580c0e7ec613bed524c9553ae9cbb9551ded8a07344ddbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0eec8bf01ccb02e1db14e75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "日々、努めてきたからこそ、\r\n今言える言葉があります。\r\n必ずやご期待に添ってみせます…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "11df45b1b5e05a9a38e40e27463a39d990f1ad0c156fd8ec0ce78caf6d83c9e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:202f5598e5faa82fe19efb8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "調整に問題はなく。ですが、不測の\r\n事態も考えられます。油断せず、\r\n気を引き締めてまいりましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f04247dda70d40e7c9e1b3248e7fcac3c7b935671ae4cf0b463233218163677",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10b746543019dc22069b1bfd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なすべきことは変わりません。\r\n好不調がない時こそ、\r\n勝利を見据え走るのみ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48a3cf3bffd6ed99583a1855b0375440abfa99234cd516f4e889bef54613cef3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4763a7dc08c4bec85607c837",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私自身に変わりはありません。\r\n事の運びは外的要因によりけり…\r\nといったところでしょうか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f643eda3cd72415466f255a0ac10d5b71845c0286f90f5a30dd7771b90a375a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13d4f56963adf2d546893157",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "万全でないとはいえ…対処の\r\nしようはいくらでもあります。\r\n体の不調は…頭脳で補います。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bd666795e1e6b09835fd023ef3835fa660f9b2105ad569542faad1f56e84b1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1b644ae0fb07d45ef77189a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "調整不足と言わざるを得ませんが…\r\n不測の事態であれ、積み重ねてきた\r\nものは揺るぎません…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6edbb590fac562b9be086641344a403a1a7c99e575042cfc1d4b165628f19cac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09b12129b637174586a80d7a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私ならば勝てる…！\r\n…不調をカバーする\r\n自己暗示のようなものです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41ab4776d67a89b0838b148b2d54508eeff1cb08b376db96f33d1f6e13c8fa10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7485b525062d3cc8e4b96b5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どんなに綿密な計画を立てても、\r\n上手くいかない事もあります…。\r\n問題は、どう立て直すかです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78711c51e03e3bdc01f7420a334cb4bbe159131760d6ccad10c31818de743c90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "20035"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
